    <string name="title_how_it_works">Global Background Operation</string>
    <string name="desc_how_it_works">GhostShare hooks into the Android OS core (system_server) and ClipboardManager to intercept copied links instantly, stripping advertising and analytic tracking parameters without breaking original content.</string>


